      "insight": "Readers click Stellar not for DeFi speculation but for TradFi legitimacy signals — every high-performing headline is a name-brand institution (CME, MoneyGram, Mastercard, Societe Generale) treating Stellar as settlement infrastructure, which means reader appetite is really a proxy for 'is this network safe enough for real money.'",
